      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Right now, to briefly check tooltip for a button in the world, you have to: open QM, then open MM, settings, user interface tab, scroll through half of the page and enable tooltips, then close the menu, check the tooltip, and go through the same steps again to disable them. Which is really inconvenient compared to how it was before. \nThe tooltips toggle in quick menu doesn't take much space and can be placed under the HUD Mode, which will also fill some of the empty space there:",
