  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Given that many worlds use tooltips to describe what the button/item does, but it is not visually appealing to always have them on (especially in VR), it would be nice having quick access to the tooltips setting to quickly check what the item/button in the world does.\nAlternatively, add the option to disable controllers outline when you have tooltips on in VR.",
